# Optional build-time overrides for where the workbench loads its auxiliary
# content from (commentary HTML, facsimile images, GORILA PDFs).
#
# By default the app reads these from the committed `public/upstream/`
# folder, which is bundled with the repo and shipped on GitHub Pages —
# so deployments are fully self-contained.
#
# To fall back to upstream CDN hosting instead (and let `public/upstream/`
# be gitignored to keep the repo small), copy this file to `.env.local`
# and uncomment:

# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mwenge/lineara.xyz/master
# VITE_COMMENTARY_BASE=https://lineara.xyz/commentary
